~ start
# Child sees first enemy
do Global.dim_lights(true)
do Global.control_spotlight(Global.stage.narrator, true)
Narrator: The mouse didn’t know how to look after itself
Narrator: Because they were so small, all the other animals wanted to catch and eat them
do Global.control_spotlight(Global.stage.player_child_body, true)
Player: I wish they'd leave me alone, I didn't do anything to them
do Global.control_spotlight(Global.stage.player_child_body, true)
do Global.dim_lights(false)
=> END